source: tests/cli/snapshots.rs
---
Update a metric

Usage: vendo metrics update [OPTIONS] <metricId>

Arguments:
  <metricId>  

Options:
      --name <name>         New name
      --description <desc>  New description
      --definition <file>   New QuerySpec v2 definition JSON file
      --format <format>     New format
      --unit <unit>         New unit
      --status <status>     New status
      --json                Output raw JSON
  -h, --help                Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo metrics update <metricId> --name "New Name"
  $ vendo metrics update <metricId> --status active
  $ vendo metrics update <metricId> --definition revised.query.json
